<title>USA: AMEX to trade Journal Register options from Aug 15.</title>
<headline>AMEX to trade Journal Register options from Aug 15.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange (AMEX) said Tuesday it will trade options on Journal Register Co shares from August 15.</p>
<p>The options will have opening strike prices of 15, 17-1/2 and 20, with position limits of 4,500 contracts.  Initial expirations have been set for September, October, November and February.</p>
<p>J. Streicher &amp; Co will be the specialist for the options.</p>
<p>Journal Register shares were unchanged at 16-1/4 Tuesday morning.</p>
<p>((--Chicago derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: chicago.derivatives.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
